-device.mdx","Enroll and connect your first device","Obtain an identity through EST, verify its association and use it in an mTLS connection.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device",{"_74":221},"platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device.mdx",{"_50":223,"_57":68,"_52":224,"_62":225,"_71":-7,"_11":226,"_72":227},"en:platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device.mdx","Register a device manually","Prepare a DMS, register a device and associate a verified certificate with its identity.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device",{"_74":228},"platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device.mdx",{"_50":230,"_57":94,"_71":-7,"_52":25},"en:_6",{"_50":232,"_57":68,"_52":25,"_62":233,"_71":-7,"_11":23,"_72":234},"en:platform/iot-fleets/device-management.mdx","Register, inspect and retire devices while checking their current identity and history.",{"_74":235},"platform/iot-fleets/device-management.mdx",{"_57":58,"_52":237,"_59":-7,"_61":-7,"_62":-7,"_64":-7,"_54":238,"_50":295,"_72":296,"_71":298,"_203":299},"Enrollment with PKI",[239,246,253,260,267,274,281,288],{"_50":240,"_57":68,"_52":241,"_62":242,"_71":-7,"_11":243,"_72":244},"en:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies.mdx","Provisioning strategies","Choose device registration, identity authorization and key generation.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies",{"_74":245},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies.mdx",{"_50":247,"_57":68,"_52":248,"_62":249,"_71":-7,"_11":250,"_72":251},"en:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx","Configure and operate the DMS","Define registration, authentication per operation, issuance, renewal and distributed trust.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms",{"_74":252},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx",{"_50":254,"_57":68,"_52":255,"_62":256,"_71":-7,"_11":257,"_72":258},"en:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.m